    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1326270/extras/290f5fbe77fdc2bf0b5c3ea3f7b81173.poster.avif?t=1727971603\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1326270/extras/290f5fbe77fdc2bf0b5c3ea3f7b81173.webm?t=1727971603\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1326270/extras/290f5fbe77fdc2bf0b5c3ea3f7b81173.mp4?t=1727971603\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Grow your music festival from a backyard bonanza into an unmissable global event, working with bands and brands to build an excellent reputation and rake in the big bucks! With career mode, sandbox mode, and even an extreme mode, there\u2019s plenty of ways to play. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1326270/extras/6da3ea08d10265933d66bb944438a18e.poster.avif?t=1727971603\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1326270/extras/6da3ea08d10265933d66bb944438a18e.webm?t=1727971603\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1326270/extras/6da3ea08d10265933d66bb944438a18e.mp4?t=1727971603\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Hire a range of bands across the likes of folk, rock and techno, balancing a finite budget against your own good taste. Upload your own music to get the vibes just right!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1326270/extras/ac562f219c2e6a2605466e4d2f50f5fe.poster.avif?t=1727971603\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1326270/extras/ac562f219c2e6a2605466e4d2f50f5fe.webm?t=1727971603\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1326270/extras/ac562f219c2e6a2605466e4d2f50f5fe.mp4?t=1727971603\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1326270/extras/72e5e7617b0ecb5f28fc0f81865540d6.poster.avif?t=1727971603\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1326270/extras/72e5e7617b0ecb5f28fc0f81865540d6.webm?t=1727971603\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1326270/extras/72e5e7617b0ecb5f28fc0f81865540d6.mp4?t=1727971603\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Pick from a wide catalogue of buildings and decorations to design a festival ground that\u2019s practical as well as pretty. Craft around a theme, use and create custom maps, load local music and \u2026<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1326270/extras/e5412cbca2f972e8da4cd5a66cc7ba28.poster.avif?t=1727971603\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1326270/extras/e5412cbca2f972e8da4cd5a66cc7ba28.webm?t=1727971603\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1326270/extras/e5412cbca2f972e8da4cd5a66cc7ba28.mp4?t=1727971603\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1326270/extras/29fe540fa4d0bb871f6c2774c6bf2406.poster.avif?t=1727971603\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1326270/extras/29fe540fa4d0bb871f6c2774c6bf2406.webm?t=1727971603\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1326270/extras/29fe540fa4d0bb871f6c2774c6bf2406.mp4?t=1727971603\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>With great contracts comes great responsibility. Sponsors might fund your dream production, but they come with high demands. Run your festival well to increase your reputation and get more funding the next time round! <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1326270/extras/2c4edda249cbede8ffaa7d81da8484cd.poster.avif?t=1727971603\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1326270/extras/2c4edda249cbede8ffaa7d81da8484cd.webm?t=1727971603\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1326270/extras/2c4edda249cbede8ffaa7d81da8484cd.mp4?t=1727971603\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1326270/extras/f238eab29a6cfb7d13d4d23d7ddc89ac.poster.avif?t=1727971603\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1326270/extras/f238eab29a6cfb7d13d4d23d7ddc89ac.webm?t=1727971603\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1326270/extras/f238eab29a6cfb7d13d4d23d7ddc89ac.mp4?t=1727971603\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Don\u2019t think you can relax once the show starts. From babysitting performers to picking up the trash, it\u2019s down to you to make sure everything runs perfectly!<br><br><strong>BUT THAT\u2019S NOT ALL\u2026!</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Design around themes like Halloween, Extreme Sports, or even a boozy Oktoberfest!<br></li><li>Micromanage your staff, hiring, firing, assigning tasks and setting patrol routes!<br></li><li>Use the Steam workshop to share and download other festivals from the community!<br></li><li>Choose from a range of biomes to create the perfect atmosphere for your festival!<br></li><li>And plenty more\u2026</li></ul><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1326270/extras/0c8c0fc9086ff411eced57b41e97b3c0.poster.avif?t=1727971603\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1326270/extras/0c8c0fc9086ff411eced57b41e97b3c0.webm?t=1727971603\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1326270/extras/0c8c0fc9086ff411eced57b41e97b3c0.mp4?t=1727971603\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
